PROJECT TITLE
AI FITNESS PLAN

1. DEVELOPMENT OVERVIEW

The AI Fitness Plan system is developed to provide personalized fitness recommendations based on the user's fitness goals and requirements.

2. DEVELOPMENT PROCESS

• Collect the required user information.
• Define the fitness goals and activity levels.
• Create the recommendation logic.
• Generate a suitable fitness plan based on the user input.
• Display the personalized fitness recommendations.

3. INPUT DATA

The system uses basic user details such as:

• Fitness goal
• Fitness level
• Available workout time
• Preferred activity

4. PROCESSING

The entered information is analyzed and matched with suitable fitness recommendations. Based on the selected goal and fitness level, an appropriate workout plan is generated.

5. OUTPUT

The system generates a personalized fitness plan containing:

• Recommended exercises
• Workout duration
• Workout frequency
• Fitness suggestions

6. DEVELOPMENT TOOLS

• Python
• Artificial Intelligence concepts
• GitHub

7. DEVELOPMENT RESULT

The developed system provides a personalized fitness plan based on the information provided by the user.

